WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Configure the shared account setup email sender in the available Settings or Opstack-owner controls.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.708
Step 2: In Users, choose Create user and complete the Name &amp; email, optional Phone &amp; clock PIN, Permissions and Locations steps in User setup.

3
00:00:14.708 --> 00:00:23.417
Step 3: Choose Review invitation and press Send invitation, then check the delivery result. Continue to the new user’s roster details or finish them later.

4
00:00:23.417 --> 00:00:36.167
Step 4: The recipient opens the setup link and chooses a password. For a failed or expired invitation, edit the existing user and choose Resend setup email. An unconfirmed send should be checked with the email service first.
